    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tender breast tissue on both sides; no discharge or new lump</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low libido and no morning erections; no testicular pain or swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No leg swelling or calf pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood and interest, poor sleep; no suicidal thoughts, elevated mood, or racing thoughts</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

