    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-04-28; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Tall, lean, tired</td></tr><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Examined with his agreement and a chaperone offered and declined: firm, tender, rubbery disc of glandular tissue about 4 cm across behind each nipple, centered and symmetric; no discrete or eccentric mass, skin change, nipple discharge, or axillary nodes</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Examined with his agreement: testes soft and slightly small, without masses, as the ultrasound confirmed</td></tr><tr><td>Mental status</td><td>Alert and cooperative; mood &quot;still flat&quot;; affect constricted but brightens on his work; thought process linear; no suicidal ideation; no psychotic features; insight and judgment good</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

